	(text "The FMC unit of U100 drives U200, an IS42S16320F-7TLI SDRAM. The device\nprovides 32M x 16 bits, or 64 MiB, of volatile storage. It belongs to the MCU\naddress space and is separate from the FPGA DDR3L memory."
